{"title":"악마의 유혹 [개정판]","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=b5oVyf/hAFPS6N6Ir/WKt5uzJKU6deTa05LKOz70&filename=th3","synopsis":"변태냐고? 스릴있는 관계를 즐기냐고? 천만에! 안정적인 삶을 꿈꾸던 무개성의 직장맨 이현. 그는 흠모하던 지부장 알렉이 참석한단 말에 휘둘려 사내 파티에 가게 된다, 하지만 평소 앙숙이던 동료 이반의 도발에 온갖 흑역사를 쌓으며 폭주해 버리는데... 다음날 아침, 어차피 필름도 끊긴 거 다 잊고 남은 연말이라도 알차게 보내자고 다짐하는 이현 앞에 나란히 누워있는 알몸의 정체는?!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":281,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-10","rank":286,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-11","rank":210,"change":{"type":"up","amount":76}},{"date":"2026-10-25","rank":282,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}}],"weekly":[],"monthly":[]},"viewSeries":[],"metricsSeries":[{"date":"2026-10-11","v":631580,"rc":3950,"rs":39311,"cc":781},{"date":"2026-10-12","v":631670,"rc":3951,"rs":39321,"cc":781},{"date":"2026-10-13","v":631767,"rc":3951,"rs":39321,"cc":781},{"date":"2026-10-14","v":631856,"rc":3951,"rs":39321,"cc":781},{"date":"2026-10-15","v":631938,"rc":3952,"rs":39331,"cc":781},{"date":"2026-10-16","v":632010,"rc":3953,"rs":39341,"cc":781},{"date":"2026-10-17","v":632117,"rc":3953,"rs":39341,"cc":783},{"date":"2026-10-18","v":632221,"rc":3954,"rs":39351,"cc":783},{"date":"2026-10-19","v":632307,"rc":3955,"rs":39361,"cc":783},{"date":"2026-10-20","v":632386,"rc":3955,"rs":39361,"cc":783},{"date":"2026-10-21","v":632460,"rc":3955,"rs":39361,"cc":783},{"date":"2026-10-22","v":632545,"rc":3957,"rs":39381,"cc":783},{"date":"2026-10-23","v":632592,"rc":3957,"rs":39381,"cc":783},{"date":"2026-10-24","v":632716,"rc":3957,"rs":39381,"cc":783},{"date":"2026-10-25","v":632813,"rc":3959,"rs":39401,"cc":783},{"date":"2026-10-26","v":632895,"rc":3959,"rs":39401,"cc":783},{"date":"2026-10-27","v":632969,"rc":3961,"rs":39421,"cc":786},{"date":"2026-10-28","v":633054,"rc":3962,"rs":39431,"cc":786},{"date":"2026-10-29","v":633136,"rc":3962,"rs":39431,"cc":786},{"date":"2026-10-30","v":63319